  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Welcome pilot! Your job is to maneuver this geological research probe
    as deep into the surface of this yet unresearched moon as possible.

    But
    be quick! The relay satelite used to communicate with the probe will get out
    of range in 60 seconds. This will mean the end of your mission.

    If for some
    reason you can not advance deeper into the crust of this moon, you shoild collect
    more samples of minerals in your reach. They can provide useful data for later
    missions.


    The probe is equipped with ground penetrating radar technology,
    so you can see some distance ahead of you. Use this to plan your route carefully
    trough different rock types.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 9676361ff082964478b886836a96f8cd, type: 2}
